# Copy to .env.local and fill in. Both values come from
# Supabase -> Project Settings -> API.
#
# VITE_ variables are embedded in the client bundle and are therefore public.
# The anon key is designed to be public: Row Level Security is what protects
# your data, not secrecy of this key.
#
# NEVER put the service_role key here. It bypasses Row Level Security entirely.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# Optional. Base path for the build. Defaults to /Nexora/.
# VITE_BASE=/Nexora/
